ية وثلاث صور للمعرض"]','A ready-to-use Microsoft Word template to organize and manage the related information in a clear, reusable workflow.','قالب جاهز للاستخدام على Microsoft Word ضمن قسم إدارة المشروعات وقابل للتعديل والتخصيص.','/storage/template-previews/word-project-management-project-plan-template/cover.png','/storage/template-previews/word-project-management-project-plan-template/sample-1.png','["/storage/template-previews/word-project-management-project-plan-template/sample-1.png", "/storage/template-previews/word-project-management-project-plan-template/sample-2.png", "/storage/template-previews/word-project-management-project-plan-template/sample-3.png"]',0,1,0.00,'1.0.0','Source license not specified; confirm redistribution and commercial-use rights before public release.',0,0.0,0,DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 1 MINUTE),'published',NULL,'Project Plan Template Microsoft Word Template | EzyTemplate','Download the editable Project Plan Template Microsoft Word template for organize and manage the related information in a clear, reusable workflow....','قالب خطة مشروع | EzyTemplate','حمّل قالب خطة مشروع القابل للتعديل ضمن قسم إدارة المشروعات. ملف منظم وجاهز للتخصيص لمساعدتك على إدارة البيانات والعمل بكفاءة.','["word", "microsoft word", "template", "editable", "project management", "project", "plan"]','Project Plan Template Microsoft Word template preview','معاينة قالب خطة مشروع',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'generated-card',NOW(),NOW()) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `category_id`=VALUES(`category_id`),`main_category_id`=VALUES(`main_category_id`),`subcategory_id`=VALUES(`subcategory_id`),`title`=VALUES(`title`),`title_ar`=VALUES(`title_ar`),`resource_type`=VALUES(`resource_type`),`tech_stack`=VALUES(`tech_stack`),`tech_stack_ar`=VALUES(`tech_stack_ar`),`description`=VALUES(`description`),`description_ar`=VALUES(`description_ar`),`features`=VALUES(`features`),`features_ar`=VALUES(`features_ar`),`short_description`=VALUES(`short_description`),`short_description_ar`=VALUES(`short_des